_note": "Filed by the perf lane 2026-09-26 (tick ai-plays-poke-perf-2026-09-24-22-13-10 nudge2). Evidence artifacts: /tmp/cold_perfcold.prof (cProfile), /tmp/cold_run.log, /tmp/importtime_full.txt, /tmp/perf_tick_boot_stages.py stage harness, cron_logs/run_perfcold_perf0926.jsonl. UNVERIFIED: post-fix escalation rate (hypothesis from the projection-input gap, not yet demonstrated); the harness measures boot mechanics in isolation, not the full 5-cycle cold wall clock without profiling overhead. Persisted decomposition artifact (in-repo, /tmp is volatile): data/baselines/perf2_cold_decomp_20260926.json — same numbers, run log at cron_logs/run_perfcold_perf0926.jsonl. T254 re-measure 2026-09-27 (run perfcold_t254, 5 cycles, --boot-state skip, same harness as perf0926, default jev mode, RSS-watchdog peak 116MB rc=0; MEM-PROJ wiring LIVE at 5d8e773): T1 FAILED - escalations 5/5, map_topology rate 1.0, teacher 1 call (5.8s, $0.0014, improved=0), profiled wall 13.21s vs 14.4s baseline = variance-level (T2 unmet). Mechanism proven: facts ARE threaded ([MEM-WORLD] N facts -> JEV projection printed 4/5 cycles; wiring at cron_runner.py:1357/4063/4398) but the retrieved /world/map/0 content itself carries adjacent_tiles up/down=unknown + visible_exits=[] - the memory writer derives adjacent-tile labels from the vision LLM prompt (src/core/vision.py:42,62) which answers unknown for uncertain tiles, and those unknowns are cached and served back forever; the gate escalates honestly. Teacher patch missing_facts never consumed as retrieval targets. Fix moves to the content side: PERF-3 filed. Off-by-one submitted sub_072cf3 (class jev-sufficiency-gate-fed-stale-memory-facts, cadence post-debug, verified pending in queue_entries).", "blocked_reason": null, "review_notes": null, "created_at": "2026-09-26 19:30:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-27 04:45:00", "blocked_since": null, "perpetual": false, "acceptance_criteria": "(T1) a 5-cycle cold run (--boot-state skip, same harness) shows JEV escalations <=1/5 and teacher_escalations=0 for map_topology when /world/map/0 facts were retrieved that run. (T2) same-command re-measure: total wall for 5 cold cycles drops vs the 14.4s cProfile baseline (expected saving ~9.7s). (T3) full suite green on merged main; fail-closed behavior preserved when memory retrieval fails (projection must tolerate missing facts)."}
